      "description": "A social and political phenomenon where citizens organize to oppose perceived injustices or unpopular policies. The meme invokes this concept by encouraging viewers to 'create a crowd and push back,' which is a form of collective action rooted in political protest traditions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
